        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’optimitza de seguida i torna al porta-retalls, més petita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was moved or deleted after it was optimised.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es va moure o eliminar després d’optimitzar-lo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its script steps run code on your Mac with your permissions. AI agents may only run this pipeline when “Agents may run scripts” is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Els seus passos d’script executen codi al Mac amb els teus permisos. Els agents d’IA només poden executar aquest pipeline si «Els agents poden executar scripts» està activat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JSON, for most agents (mcpServers)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JSON, per a la majoria d’agents (mcpServers)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conserva"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep L'Esclop in the menu bar after a restart, so copies are optimised from the start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén L’Esclop a la barra de menús després de reiniciar, perquè les còpies s’optimitzin des del primer moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep every frame": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conserva tots els fotogrames"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep it as it is": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deixa-la com està"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the frame rate": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conserva la freqüència de fotogrames"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the optimised file and close": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conserva el fitxer optimitzat i tanca"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep visible": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantén visible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
